  "resume": "=== Benjamin Medrano - Resume.pdf ===\nContact \nmedranobenji2006@gmail.com \n(929) 267-6627 \nBronx, NY 10458 \n\nSkills \nCustomer Service \nIntermediate \nBilingualCommunication \nIntermediate \nTechnical Support \nIntermediate \n\nLanguages \nEnglish \nSpanish \n\nBenjamin Medrano \n\nMOTIVATED HIGH SCHOOL GRADUATE | BILINGUAL \nCUSTOMER SERVICE & IT SUPPORT \n\nProfessional Summary \n\nReliable and engaging high school graduate with proven customer service \nexcellence, bilingual communication abilities, and strong organizational \nskills. Demonstrated ability to work effectively in team environments, \nmanage multiple tasks, and maintain professional standards. Eager to \napply communication and service. \n\nProfessional Experience \n\nIntern \u2013 Duro Internship    2022-03 \u2013 2022-09 \nR.A.I.N INC CENTER | Bronx, NY \nProvided technical support and organizational assistance in a professional \ninternship setting. \n\n\u2022  Troubleshot hardware and software issues, improving user \n\nexperience. \n\n\u2022  Assisted clients with technical problems, delivering clear and \n\neffective guidance. \n\n\u2022  Organized office inventory, enhancing workspace efficiency and \n\naccessibility. \n\nStudent Intern    2023-05 \u2013 2023-09 \nCrotona International High School | Bronx, NY \nSupported school activities and provided translation services to facilitate \ncommunication. \n\n\u2022  Assisted with Spanish\u2013English translations for students and teachers. \n\u2022  Led group projects, coordinating responsibilities among peers. \n\u2022  Collaborated effectively with classmates, demonstrating teamwork \n\nexcellence. \n\nIntern \u2013 Montefiore Einstein Comprehensive Cancer Center    \n2023-11 \u2013 2024-05 \nMontefiore Einstein Cancer Center | Bronx, NY \nSupported administrative and organizational tasks within a healthcare \nresearch environment. \n\n\u2022  Organized office supplies and inventory, streamlining operations. \n\u2022  Assisted staff with technical troubleshooting and administrative \n\ntasks. \n\n\u2022  Contributed to a productive work environment through efficient \n\norganization. \n\nEducation \n\nHigh School Diploma in Leadership, Bilingual Communication, and \nTechnical Skills \nCrotona International High School \n2021 - 2025-06",
